body:
Hi {{first_name}},

This is a reminder that a piece of coursework is due soon.

  Assignment: {{title}}
  Subject:    {{subject_name}}
  Teacher:    {{teacher}}
  Due:        {{due_date}}  ({{days_left}} day(s) away)
  Submit via: {{submission_method}}
  Your status: {{status}}

If you have already handed this in, you can ignore this message — the status above tells you what we have recorded, so check it matches what you think you submitted.

If you are stuck, say so now rather than the night before. {{teacher}} would far rather hear from you with {{days_left}} days left than receive nothing on the deadline.

{{system_name}}
